   "picture": "06_Inside_the_Cell.jpg",
   "voice_start_s": 35.056,
   "voice_end_s": 40.176,
   "pause_after_s": 0.55,
   "yue": "要答呢個問題，我哋先睇吓細胞呢座日夜運作嘅城市。"
